      "One same App session busy/defer owner; real developerAccountOwner revalidates actual Bundle/Vault, actual pending check before transaction retirement.",
      "Same coordinator.retireBeforeMaterialRefresh() precedes any certificate-list/profile request; existing upload/Upgrade/receipt/Lookup/attention cases refuse activeTransaction.",
      "Only the retained same Client.reconcilePendingMaterials() is called; no CSR, new key, second journal, provider, owner, queue or UI trigger.",
      "Actual post-Vault finalization failure remains DeveloperMaterialFinalizationFailure with the real published observation, retained by Session and Owner.",
      "Existing finalizeDeveloperMaterialPublication remains unchanged and local-only. No startup/foreground reconciliation added."
    ],
